    {
      "name": "Gelid Breath",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The tatzlwyrm belches a puff of frigid vapor into the face of an adjacent creature, which must attempt a DC 15 Fortitude Saving Throw save; the creature takes a -2 circumstance penalty to this save if it's Grabbed or Off-Guard. The tatzlwyrm can't use Gelid Breath again for 2 rounds.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is Clumsy 1 for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes 2d6 Cold Damage damage and is clumsy 1 for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes 4d6 Cold Damage damage and is clumsy 1 for 1 minute.</p>",
